## 3. Model structure

The model used the six-source auditory hierarchy based on the Phillips et al. frequency-deviant model architecture:

| Source number | Source name | MNI coordinates |
|---:|---|---|
| 1 | left A1 | `[-42 -22 7]` |
| 2 | right A1 | `[46 -14 8]` |
| 3 | left STG | `[-61 -32 8]` |
| 4 | right STG | `[59 -25 8]` |
| 5 | left IFG | `[-46 20 8]` |
| 6 | right IFG | `[46 20 8]` |

The network structure was:

```text
left A1  <-> left STG  <-> left IFG
right A1 <-> right STG <-> right IFG
left IFG <-> right IFG
```

The external auditory input entered bilateral A1:

```text
left A1
right A1
```

No direct driving input was specified for STG or IFG.

