## 4. DCM options

The baseline model used the following DCM options:

```matlab
DCM.options.trials   = [1 2];
DCM.options.Tdcm     = [-100 300];
DCM.options.analysis = 'ERP';
DCM.options.model    = 'CMC';
DCM.options.spatial  = 'IMG';
DCM.options.Nmodes   = 8;
DCM.options.h        = 1;
DCM.options.onset    = 60;
DCM.options.D        = 1;
DCM.options.han      = 1;
```

The condition-specific design was coded as:

```matlab
DCM.xU.X = [0; 1];
DCM.xU.name = {'Pitch Deviant'};
```

This means:

```text
Standard      = 0
Pitch Deviant = 1
```

Therefore:

```text
Standard connectivity      = A
Pitch Deviant connectivity = A + B
```

