## 21. Overall Day 3 conclusion

The baseline six-source CMC DCM was successfully inverted and visually inspected.

The model produced:

```matlab
DCM.F = 64.2175
```

The fitted model reproduced the main temporal, spatial and condition-specific structure of the grand-average MEG responses. No evidence of gross model failure, unstable dynamics, implausible input structure or uninterpretable connectivity estimates was observed.

The baseline model was therefore retained as the reference model for later receptor-informed DCM comparisons.

